(7080255, 1077349, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of slow shutter speed to capture the motion of the flowing river. I would say to maybe stop the shutter speed down by another 1/2 stop and the flow would be creamy yet still with a little detail. I can still see a little of the stopped action of the whitewater hitting the rocks, so that is why I suggest that.<br/> <br/>As far as the color, looks like you got the sunny part of the photo color corrected well, but left the shady part a little blue from the reflection of the sky. Finding a scene with more even light may help with that.</td>', 'Nice use of slow shutter speed to capture the motion of the flowing river. I would say to maybe stop the shutter speed down by another 1/2 stop and the flow would be creamy yet still with a little detail. I can still see a little of the stopped action of the whitewater hitting the rocks, so that is why I suggest that. As far as the color, looks like you got the sunny part of the photo color corrected well, but left the shady part a little blue from the reflection of the sky. Finding a scene with more even light may help with that.', '2013-08-01 21:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080257, 1077393, 10785, '<td valign="top">Ansel?! Is that you?</td>', 'Ansel?! Is that you?', '2013-08-01 21:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080260, 1077649, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I think I would like this better in portrait orientation. The lines of the steps lead me outwards to the bushes. If it was shot in portrait orientation, the steps would lead right up to the portico which frames the upper body of the girl and would draw me right there.</td>', 'Lovely shot. I think I would like this better in portrait orientation. The lines of the steps lead me outwards to the bushes. If it was shot in portrait orientation, the steps would lead right up to the portico which frames the upper body of the girl and would draw me right there.', '2013-08-01 21:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080263, 1077622, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset. I think you have included a bit too much in the frame. Try cropping this in portrait orientation leaving the horizon on the top third, centering the sun reflection and eliminating the top left corner of this shot completely. That would be the money shot!</td>', 'Lovely sunset. I think you have included a bit too much in the frame. Try cropping this in portrait orientation leaving the horizon on the top third, centering the sun reflection and eliminating the top left corner of this shot completely. That would be the money shot!', '2013-08-01 21:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080266, 1077099, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors! I know the sky provides context, but try framing the balloons without the sky! All that color and shape would remain!</td>', 'Lovely colors! I know the sky provides context, but try framing the balloons without the sky! All that color and shape would remain!', '2013-08-01 21:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080268, 1075483, 10785, '<td valign="top">I love the emotion in this. I do think the darkness on the bottom leaves this out of balance and a little bottom heavy.</td>', 'I love the emotion in this. I do think the darkness on the bottom leaves this out of balance and a little bottom heavy.', '2013-08-01 21:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7080277, 1077180, 87808, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, seems a little soft though, so sharpening would bring it out.  Adore the bridge in the background, makes the whole thing come together, well done 7</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, seems a little soft though, so sharpening would bring it out.  Adore the bridge in the background, makes the whole thing come together, well done 7', '2013-08-01 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
