(7082160, 1075793, 49018, '<td valign="top">Among the many flowers, I find this particularly pleasant. Love the softness and the muted tones, could almost touch it and feel the texture of the petals. Good job.</td>', 'Among the many flowers, I find this particularly pleasant. Love the softness and the muted tones, could almost touch it and feel the texture of the petals. Good job.', '2013-08-05 23:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
