(7082412, 1077433, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful vertical with anchor point. VWD.</td>', 'Wonderful vertical with anchor point. VWD.', '2013-08-06 09:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082413, 1075895, 108580, '<td valign="top">A beauty. Needs to be the poster child for all macro workshops: "Get the eye''s and nose in focus". 7</td>', 'A beauty. Needs to be the poster child for all macro workshops: "Get the eye''s and nose in focus". 7', '2013-08-06 09:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082418, 1077583, 108580, '<td valign="top">Best time of day. Bumped to 8.</td>', 'Best time of day. Bumped to 8.', '2013-08-06 09:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082420, 1077446, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject and unusual sighting. Perfect refreshing image for a FS. 7.</td>', 'Wonderful subject and unusual sighting. Perfect refreshing image for a FS. 7.', '2013-08-06 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082458, 1076971, 114225, '<td valign="top">While the photo isn''t bad, it doesn''t grab me either. I find myself wishing for a long exposure to smooth out the water and add drama to the sky.</td>', 'While the photo isn''t bad, it doesn''t grab me either. I find myself wishing for a long exposure to smooth out the water and add drama to the sky.', '2013-08-06 11:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082460, 1077593, 114225, '<td valign="top">A compelling use of fish eye. A lot of eye warping going on.</td>', 'A compelling use of fish eye. A lot of eye warping going on.', '2013-08-06 11:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082461, 1077639, 114225, '<td valign="top">Definitely a nice basic portrait, but this type of image doesn''t really stand out to me.</td>', 'Definitely a nice basic portrait, but this type of image doesn''t really stand out to me.', '2013-08-06 11:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082462, 1077000, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I wonder if she is waiting for her home planet to beam her back.<br/>I''m not too fond of what the vignette has done here.</td>', 'Great capture. I wonder if she is waiting for her home planet to beam her back.I''m not too fond of what the vignette has done here.', '2013-08-06 11:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082463, 1077508, 114225, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, looking close I do see the little lighthouse. I enjoy the colors in this.</td>', 'Oh yeah, looking close I do see the little lighthouse. I enjoy the colors in this.', '2013-08-06 11:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082466, 1077392, 114225, '<td valign="top">A lot of power encroaching on that visitor to the rocky ledge.</td>', 'A lot of power encroaching on that visitor to the rocky ledge.', '2013-08-06 11:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082467, 1077296, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is a bit intense. The shadow works to really highlight his belly.</td>', 'Wow, that is a bit intense. The shadow works to really highlight his belly.', '2013-08-06 11:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082469, 1077633, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cultural image, I like that. But it seems like there is some very strange vignette and even stranger blurring that was added to the photo, seemingly at random.</td>', 'Very cultural image, I like that. But it seems like there is some very strange vignette and even stranger blurring that was added to the photo, seemingly at random.', '2013-08-06 11:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082470, 1075530, 114225, '<td valign="top">Now that is a fun an creepy street scene.</td>', 'Now that is a fun an creepy street scene.', '2013-08-06 11:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082471, 1077595, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like looking down onto these flowers like your presentation here.<br/>On my monitor, it seems a little dark, like it could use a bump in exposure.</td>', 'I really like looking down onto these flowers like your presentation here.On my monitor, it seems a little dark, like it could use a bump in exposure.', '2013-08-06 11:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082472, 1077179, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s a fun wedding photo. One to cherish :)</td>', 'That''s a fun wedding photo. One to cherish :)', '2013-08-06 11:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082473, 1076521, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very intimate image. Good use of shadow.</td>', 'Very intimate image. Good use of shadow.', '2013-08-06 11:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082474, 1077382, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo has such strong mood to it. I like it.</td>', 'This photo has such strong mood to it. I like it.', '2013-08-06 11:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082475, 1077617, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The mist over the water really adds a lot.</td>', 'Nicely done. The mist over the water really adds a lot.', '2013-08-06 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082476, 1075284, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good composition to get this portrait. But watch out with the extremes in the histogram. There are some blacks that seem overly black, and some blown highlights.</td>', 'Good composition to get this portrait. But watch out with the extremes in the histogram. There are some blacks that seem overly black, and some blown highlights.', '2013-08-06 11:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082478, 1077707, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy how the orange contrasts with the blue.</td>', 'I really enjoy how the orange contrasts with the blue.', '2013-08-06 11:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082479, 1075793, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit. I''m not sure how you got the softness, but it really makes this appealing.</td>', 'Very nicely lit. I''m not sure how you got the softness, but it really makes this appealing.', '2013-08-06 11:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082481, 1077444, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool portrait with great exposure looking into the sun.<br/>I might suggest trying to crop the left of the image, just slightly past her hair. I think that will focus more attention on her and make her stand out more.</td>', 'Very cool portrait with great exposure looking into the sun.I might suggest trying to crop the left of the image, just slightly past her hair. I think that will focus more attention on her and make her stand out more.', '2013-08-06 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
