(7082731, 1077440, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice exposure control, like the low key image and following the strings around is interesting to do.  The processing looks slightly cool (blue) to me and I''d prefer a more neutral tone.</td>', 'nice exposure control, like the low key image and following the strings around is interesting to do.  The processing looks slightly cool (blue) to me and I''d prefer a more neutral tone.', '2013-08-06 19:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
