(7082841, 1077633, 114285, '<td valign="top">Strange image in which the couple to the right look so sharp and yet the man on the elephant is soft, the couple almost look like they don''t belong there, I kind of wish they didn''t and that you focused only on the elephant, with the water jetting upwards, still overall a very interesting image.</td>', 'Strange image in which the couple to the right look so sharp and yet the man on the elephant is soft, the couple almost look like they don''t belong there, I kind of wish they didn''t and that you focused only on the elephant, with the water jetting upwards, still overall a very interesting image.', '2013-08-07 00:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082943, 1077099, 108580, '<td valign="top">Bright, colourful, sharp. 7. I''d possibly have cropped the daylight to the right of the yellow balloons red patch out.</td>', 'Bright, colourful, sharp. 7. I''d possibly have cropped the daylight to the right of the yellow balloons red patch out.', '2013-08-07 03:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082946, 1077390, 25355, '<td valign="top">Would be perfect with a bit more sky, I think.</td>', 'Would be perfect with a bit more sky, I think.', '2013-08-07 03:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082951, 1077444, 86218, '<td valign="top">Really a great shot with the warm tones and soft mood. The pose of the model does however not mirror this and creates more tension and discomform and I can rather more think about her discomfort. Im no pro with these kind of scenes but only saying how I percieve this shot. Technically it''s perfect. Maybe have cloned out that one bright blade of grass on the left of image.</td>', 'Really a great shot with the warm tones and soft mood. The pose of the model does however not mirror this and creates more tension and discomform and I can rather more think about her discomfort. Im no pro with these kind of scenes but only saying how I percieve this shot. Technically it''s perfect. Maybe have cloned out that one bright blade of grass on the left of image.', '2013-08-07 03:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082967, 1076735, 108580, '<td valign="top">I appreciate it when images like this are entered to the Free Studies. There is something about the serenity of nature that is lost when only man made structures or portraits etc. are entered. Lovely shapes, forms, exposure. Very brave. 7. WD.</td>', 'I appreciate it when images like this are entered to the Free Studies. There is something about the serenity of nature that is lost when only man made structures or portraits etc. are entered. Lovely shapes, forms, exposure. Very brave. 7. WD.', '2013-08-07 04:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082969, 1076842, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and great BG but too centrally composed. I''d have cropped at least up to foreshank or the brown collar from the left hand side for a better more striking image. (i.e. Head and shoulders)</td>', 'Lovely image and great BG but too centrally composed. I''d have cropped at least up to foreshank or the brown collar from the left hand side for a better more striking image. (i.e. Head and shoulders)', '2013-08-07 04:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7082970, 1074822, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great flight shot of these little F1''s on wings :) Perfect still head and blurred wings. Great BG. I find the central composition in this instance to suit the image, especially as it is crucifixion in look and feel. (It however concerns me that as there is no environment (flower(s), stems, branches) that to me screams "baited site") From a photographic skill and technicals POV it''s worth at least an 8. More if there''s real nectar and flowers, pushing the skill required up exponentially.</td>', 'Great flight shot of these little F1''s on wings :) Perfect still head and blurred wings. Great BG. I find the central composition in this instance to suit the image, especially as it is crucifixion in look and feel. (It however concerns me that as there is no environment (flower(s), stems, branches) that to me screams "baited site") From a photographic skill and technicals POV it''s worth at least an 8. More if there''s real nectar and flowers, pushing the skill required up exponentially.', '2013-08-07 04:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083027, 1075793, 119419, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colour and softness of this</td>', 'I like the muted colour and softness of this', '2013-08-07 07:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
