(7083151, 1077581, 134859, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photo.  This is one I could imagine stretched out on a piece of canvas, hanging on the wall.  Beautiful piece!  I really must learn how you do this!  It looks like a painting, rather than a photograph.  <br/>Abstract beauty in it''s most beautiful form!  <br/>9</td>', 'I absolutely love this photo.  This is one I could imagine stretched out on a piece of canvas, hanging on the wall.  Beautiful piece!  I really must learn how you do this!  It looks like a painting, rather than a photograph.  Abstract beauty in it''s most beautiful form!  9', '2013-08-07 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083152, 1077173, 134859, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo!  Love the composition, the little girl looking down, the focus.  A very classic looking B&amp;W photograph.  Bumping score.  Second favorite in the challenge.  :)</td>', 'Gorgeous photo!  Love the composition, the little girl looking down, the focus.  A very classic looking B&W photograph.  Bumping score.  Second favorite in the challenge.  :)', '2013-08-07 11:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083153, 1077617, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors.  <br/>Love the dark contrast against the bright orange and yellow skies.  The fog gives it a boost, and is that a turtle in the water, or just a log?  <br/>Nicely captured.  <br/>Bumping score</td>', 'Lovely colors.  Love the dark contrast against the bright orange and yellow skies.  The fog gives it a boost, and is that a turtle in the water, or just a log?  Nicely captured.  Bumping score', '2013-08-07 11:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083154, 1077018, 134859, '<td valign="top">Lovely vibrant colors!  Excellent sharpness.  A very pleasing photograph to look at.  <br/>Bumping score</td>', 'Lovely vibrant colors!  Excellent sharpness.  A very pleasing photograph to look at.  Bumping score', '2013-08-07 11:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083156, 1075210, 134859, '<td valign="top">I have always wanted to shoot the sky at night.  It''s still a process I''m learning (I still have a lot to learn anyways.  lol)<br/>Great capture.  Love the trees on the bottom of the frame, gives a wonderful contrast to the photo.  <br/>Nicely done.  <br/>Bumping score.</td>', 'I have always wanted to shoot the sky at night.  It''s still a process I''m learning (I still have a lot to learn anyways.  lol)Great capture.  Love the trees on the bottom of the frame, gives a wonderful contrast to the photo.  Nicely done.  Bumping score.', '2013-08-07 11:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083158, 1077508, 134859, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the softness of this photograph.  The colors are just beautiful, and the contrast of the trees against the sky and water make the photo really stand out amongst the crowd.  <br/>Bumping score.  <br/>Well done.</td>', 'I really enjoy the softness of this photograph.  The colors are just beautiful, and the contrast of the trees against the sky and water make the photo really stand out amongst the crowd.  Bumping score.  Well done.', '2013-08-07 11:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
