(7083502, 1077669, 65234, '<td valign="top">In case you are getting any comments about an odd rotation on your image, I thought I''d mention that on my iPad this shows up rotated 90 degrees to the left.  Which is certainly unusual :-)  On my laptop it''s fine. I''ve seen that happen before with some of my own photos, and the only way I fixed it was to copy the image and paste it as a new image and save it minus the EXIF data before uploading to DPC.</td>', 'In case you are getting any comments about an odd rotation on your image, I thought I''d mention that on my iPad this shows up rotated 90 degrees to the left.  Which is certainly unusual :-)  On my laptop it''s fine. I''ve seen that happen before with some of my own photos, and the only way I fixed it was to copy the image and paste it as a new image and save it minus the EXIF data before uploading to DPC.', '2013-08-07 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7083505, 1077684, 59737, '<td valign="top">Lots of detail in his skin, good sharp focus, the processing goes well with his image, wish I could see more of his eye.</td>', 'Lots of detail in his skin, good sharp focus, the processing goes well with his image, wish I could see more of his eye.', '2013-08-07 22:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
