(7083614, 1077582, 59737, '<td valign="top">Horses seem like tough subjects, I''ve never tried shooting pictures of one but they always seem to be moving.  The focus here seems to be more on the bridle and not on the eyes.  The framing and centered composition doesn''t work well for me on this picture.  I''d prefer if the area on the right were cropped tight to the horse.</td>', 'Horses seem like tough subjects, I''ve never tried shooting pictures of one but they always seem to be moving.  The focus here seems to be more on the bridle and not on the eyes.  The framing and centered composition doesn''t work well for me on this picture.  I''d prefer if the area on the right were cropped tight to the horse.', '2013-08-07 22:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
