(7083746, 1077677, 152252, '<td valign="top">So far my favorite in the challenge. I''ve been looking through some nice but boring FS like pictures and finally I saw this. That''s what I like. It''s different, grainy, b&amp;w, cropped in a risky way (I love the cropping), and most importantly it makes me think, unlike all the pretty pictures of landscapes and animals. Thank you for that! 10</td>', 'So far my favorite in the challenge. I''ve been looking through some nice but boring FS like pictures and finally I saw this. That''s what I like. It''s different, grainy, b&w, cropped in a risky way (I love the cropping), and most importantly it makes me think, unlike all the pretty pictures of landscapes and animals. Thank you for that! 10', '2013-08-08 00:18:35.000000', NULL, 1);
