(7083914, 1077390, 72134, '<td valign="top">Thanks.<br/>This photo was captured very early in the morning, just before I was surrounded with billions of flies, which comes up from the lake, moss and sand by dawn. I was fishing there for 3 days and shot a lot. Almost nothing but moss and volcanic sand plus lavas, but unusual good weather in the highlands in Iceland -a new temperature-record 26°C. Sunshine during days and fog in the short nights. Here is on more: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_edit.php?IMAGE_ID=1078392" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_edit.php?IMAGE_ID=1078392</a></td>', 'Thanks.This photo was captured very early in the morning, just before I was surrounded with billions of flies, which comes up from the lake, moss and sand by dawn. I was fishing there for 3 days and shot a lot. Almost nothing but moss and volcanic sand plus lavas, but unusual good weather in the highlands in Iceland -a new temperature-record 26°C. Sunshine during days and fog in the short nights. Here is on more: //www.dpchallenge.com/portfolio_edit.php?IMAGE_ID=1078392', '2013-08-08 05:50:22.000000', NULL, 0),
