(7084228, 1077197, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Seems you''re too far away... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>That''s a standard complaint of mine. Don''t take it the wrong way. Quite a coming together of cultures here. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I would agree. The circumstances didn''t allow me getting closer though. I''m a bit disappointed nobody referred to the text in the background, without which this image wouldn''t have been shown here.</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Originally posted by bvy: Seems you''re too far away...  That''s a standard complaint of mine. Don''t take it the wrong way. Quite a coming together of cultures here.  I would agree. The circumstances didn''t allow me getting closer though. I''m a bit disappointed nobody referred to the text in the background, without which this image wouldn''t have been shown here.', '2013-08-08 18:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
